<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- Copywriting Frameworks -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

    <!-- PAS Framework -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">PAS Framework</h3>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">Problem</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Identify the pain point clearly</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Managing your team's time off is a spreadsheet nightmare."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-orange-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-orange-700 mb-1">Agitate</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Make the problem feel urgent</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Double bookings. Lost requests. Angry employees. You're stuck playing email ping-pong."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-green-700 mb-1">Solution</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Present your product as the answer</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"TimeOff makes leave management effortless. One click approvals, automated sync, zero spreadsheets."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AIDA Framework -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">AIDA Framework</h3>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-700 mb-1">Attention</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Stop the scroll with a hook</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Hiring developers takes 90 days. We do it in 48 hours."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-purple-700 mb-1">Interest</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Show how it works</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Browse 500+ pre-vetted profiles. Message instantly. Start interviews today."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-pink-700 mb-1">Desire</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Paint the outcome</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Skip the 6-week recruiting slog. Get back to building your product."</p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-red-700 mb-1">Action</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Clear call-to-action</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">"Browse developers now →"</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Before-After-Bridge -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-purple-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Before-After-Bridge</h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Before</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Describe their current pain</p>
        <div class="bg-red-50 rounded p-3 text-xs text-gray-700">
          "Right now, you're manually tracking invoices in spreadsheets. It takes hours each week, mistakes slip through, and clients get frustrated with late bills."
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">After</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Show the transformation</p>
        <div class="bg-green-50 rounded p-3 text-xs text-gray-700">
          "Imagine invoices that send themselves on time, every time. Payments tracked automatically. No more spreadsheet hell. Just effortless billing."
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Bridge</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Your product is the bridge</p>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded p-3 text-xs text-gray-700">
          "InvoiceFlow automates your entire billing workflow. Set it once, forget it forever. Join 5,000+ freelancers who bill on autopilot."
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Headline Formulas -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Proven Headline Formulas</h3>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">[Do Something Hard] in [Short Time]</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">"Build a landing page in 10 minutes"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">[Achieve Outcome] Without [Common Pain]</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">"Grow your email list without annoying popups"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">The [Adjective] Way to [Achieve Goal]</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">"The fastest way to find product-market fit"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">[Number] [Ways/Secrets/Tips] to [Benefit]</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">"7 proven ways to double your conversion rate"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Get [Benefit] in [Timeframe] or [Guarantee]</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">"Get your first customer in 30 days or your money back"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Power Words -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-amber-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Power Words That Convert</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-blue-600">Instant</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-purple-600">Proven</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-green-600">Effortless</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-red-600">Limited</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-indigo-600">Exclusive</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-pink-600">Guaranteed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-orange-600">Simple</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center p-3 bg-white rounded-lg">
        <span class="font-bold text-teal-600">Results</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-4">Use sparingly. One power word per headline. Overuse kills credibility.</p>
  </div>

</div>
